What is it that im trying to solve?
Lots of people find it challenging to keep track of thier daily expenses. Without all records saved its hard to monitor spending habits 
and manage personel finances.

What idea did you arrive at to solve it?
I developed an application called the "Personal Expense Tracker" using python. It has a simple menu to make it easy to use and 
navigate. This app will help you to easily add,view,edit,delete and search all your expenses. it also provides the user with a 
category summary and calculates the total expenditure.

Algorithm:-
1. Start the program.
2. Display the main menu
3. Ask the user to choose an option by entering a number between 1-8.
4. If user chooses Add expense, collect expense details and store them.
5. If the user chooses view expenses, display all saved expenses.
6. If the user chooses edit expense, allow the user to modify an already entered expense.
7. If the user chooses delete expense, remove the selected expense.
8. If the user chooses search expense, display expenses matching the search keyword.
9. If the user chooses category summary, calculate and display the overall spending for each category.
10. If the user chooses total spending, calculate and display the overall spending.
11. Repeat the menu until the user chooses Exit.
13. End the Program.

Python Code
The code didnt need any external libraries. While i used multiple Data Structures like functions to oraganiz the code. A list to 
save all expenses. Dictionaries to store each separate expense. loops to repeatedly display the menu. Conditional statements to 
process user choices and input validation to reduce invalid entries.

